{'symbol': 'XOM', 'date': '2019-12-21 00:30:00', 'title': 'EXXONMOBIL BEGINS OIL PRODUCTION IN GUYANA', 'text': 'BEGINS OIL PRODUCTION IN GUYANA.PRODUCTION FOR LIZA PHASE 1 TO REACH FULL CAPACITY OF 120,000 BARRELS OF OIL PER DAY IN COMING MONTHS.MORE THAN 1,700 GUYANESE HAVE WORKED ON EXXONMOBIL ACTIVITIES IN GUYANA.OIL PRODUCTION HAS STARTED FROM LIZA FIELD OFFSHORE GUYANA AHEAD OF SCHEDULE.EXXONMOBIL AND ITS DIRECT CONTRACTORS HAVE SPENT APPROXIMATELY $180 MILLION WITH MORE THAN 630 LOCAL SUPPLIERS SINCE 2015.'}